=== tally/README.md
# tally

A Bayan library. Its code is in `src/tally/`; other packages use it with `import tally;`.

## Test

```
bayan test
```
=== tally/docs/.gitkeep
=== tally/package.byn
Package {
    name: "local/tally",      // `local/` until published under a verified namespace
    version: "0.1.0",
    edition: 2027,
    kind: .lib,
    capabilities: [],
    deps: [],
    dist: Dist {
        targets: [.host],        // the machine that builds it
        mode: .safe,
    },
}
=== tally/src/tally/tally.byn
/// Returns twice `x`.
public i64 twice(i64 x) {
    return x * 2;
}
=== tally/testdata/.gitkeep
=== tally/tests/tally.test.byn
test "twice doubles" {
    assert(twice(21) == 42);
}
